00:05:21.385 --> 00:05:25.925
I would rather log a flat week than force a momentum name through a filter it has not cleared.

00:05:26.525 --> 00:05:30.905
Waiting for the volume filter on a catalyst name, rather than filling the print is the technique

00:05:30.905 --> 00:05:31.605
