00:05:42.886 --> 00:05:46.746
I have no financial relationship with WealthSimple or with interactive brokers.

00:05:47.366 --> 00:05:51.826
Canadian investors can harvest losses up to the annual contribution room without walking

00:05:51.826 --> 00:05:55.086
