00:05:55.606 --> 00:06:00.206
The feature lives inside the app under the Tax tab at no extra cost for premium users.

00:06:00.206 --> 00:06:05.206
It flags potential violations before they occur and hands back a replacement list that

00:06:05.206 --> 00:06:09.826
keeps similar sector exposure while resetting adjusted cost-base for the next cycle.

00:06:10.326 --> 00:06:14.846
A pullback that leaves names below their 5-year average multiple is the same tape where

00:06:14.846 --> 00:06:18.666
a harvested loss and a replacement ETF can be lined up in one sitting.

00:06:19.626 --> 00:06:24.886
Interactive brokers will flag a name when volume prints at least 150% of the 20-day average

00:06:25.206 --> 00:06:28.746
and the last price sits within 2% of the 50-day moving average.

00:06:28.746 --> 00:06:34.106
Alerts can fire before the open, so a pre-market pass can check the volume confirmation rule,

00:06:34.466 --> 00:06:36.206
without staring at the book all session.

00:06:36.846 --> 00:06:41.666
Flagged symbols export into a watch list that updates in real time, which is the mechanical

00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:44.766
way to catch a spike that finally clears the 20-day threshold.

00:06:45.366 --> 00:06:50.666
That export step is what I would run on trade web when cash markets reopen, rather than guessing

00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:52.226
