00:09:19.505 --> 00:09:25.185
Start the TFSA at wealth simple or quest trade, both no commission and only then wire

00:09:25.185 --> 00:09:30.705
the cash. Make sure cash set aside for at least three months of bills already exists, so

00:09:30.705 --> 00:09:35.905
the $10,000 is not the emergency fund by another name. The first holding should be a single

00:09:35.905 --> 00:09:41.885
broad exchange traded fund, total market Canadian or global equity, with an annual fee under

00:09:41.885 --> 00:09:43.665
0.25%.

00:09:43.665 --> 00:09:48.945
Set an automatic $200 monthly contribution from the paycheck on the same day as that first

00:09:48.945 --> 00:09:49.205
