00:09:49.805 --> 00:09:54.445
The click is the hard part, size it so a 5% dropped does not trigger a panic sale.

00:09:55.005 --> 00:10:00.985
Long-term averages sit near 7% a year, with individual years anywhere from down 20% to

00:10:00.985 --> 00:10:05.685
